    {
      "title": "The Zone’s Keys",
      "desc": "DNSKEY records, signed too",
      "detail": "The resolver asks for example.com’s keys. There are two: the zone-signing key (flags 256) that signed the A record, and the key-signing key (flags 257), which signs only the set of keys. With them the resolver checks both signatures. But who says these keys belong to example.com?",
