    {
      "title": "Vouched by .com",
      "desc": "The parent’s DS record",
      "detail": "The parent zone answers that. The .com servers hold a DS record for example.com: a hash of its key-signing key, signed with .com’s own key. If the hash matches key 61845, the keys are example.com’s, as far as .com is concerned.",
